			"Message": "style(Mist): Standardise table alignment and list indentation in docs\n\nReformat the Shim Compatibility table in Architecture.md with consistent column alignment dashes and adjust the em-dash to hyphen in prose, matching the project-wide punctuation and table conventions established in prior formatting passes.\n\nNormalise the Related Documentation list indentation in README.md from tab-based to consistent two-space continuation across all list items, fixing the whitespace inconsistency introduced by earlier mixed-formatting.\n\nNo content changes — documentation formatting only.\n\nRefs 9d625d1, 4c83435",
			"SHA": "78c6aa1f9abfbb0ac0883573e59deac67da26c37"
		},
