			],
			"Message": "style(Mist): Replace em-dashes with hyphens in README.md\n\nStandardise all em-dash (—) typographic characters to regular hyphens (-) across the README for consistency with the project's plain-text formatting conventions. Em-dashes in markdown source can cause inconsistent rendering across editors and diff tools.\n\nAffects bullet lists, definition lists, the Related Documentation section, and inline descriptions throughout the file. No content changes.",
